1306..1380 Comment "/// A forged section: the loop arm answers with the rest\'s path unchanged,"
1381..1459 Comment "/// typed at the motive at `q`, where the arm owes the motive at `loop ∷ q`:"
1460..1539 Comment "/// a path from `loop ∷ spin(wind(q))` to `loop ∷ q`. The two path types do"
1540..1580 Comment "/// not convert, and the arm is refused."
