1943..2024 Comment "/// checks at its letter, but at `loop ∷ back(loop) ∷ q` the loop arm carries"
2025..2105 Comment "/// the inverse arm\'s reflexivity to `here(loop ∷ back(loop) ∷ q)`, which is"
2106..2181 Comment "/// not the path at `q` the cancellation\'s right side reads. Read as a set,"
2182..2250 Comment "/// the loops would identify the two; the words are not read as one."
